  "worked_solution": "Our quantified statement reads as follows:\n\n$\\,$ There **exists** $m\\in N$ and there **exists** $n\\in N$ **such that** $m+n=10.$\n\nThis can be re-phrased as follows:\n\n$\\,$ There exist natural numbers $m$ and $n$ such that $m+n=10.$",
